Route108_Text_H0_0::
    .string "Careful. The hull's right under\n"
    .string "you and it's sharp where it rusted.$"

Route108_Text_H0_1::
    .string "Lost, and over a graveyard too.$"

Route108_Text_H0_2::
    .string "Ships are quiet things once the\n"
    .string "engines stop.$"

Route108_Text_H1_0::
    .string "I dive here every week. I've never\n"
    .string "come up with anything worth the\l"
    .string "trip.$"

Route108_Text_H1_1::
    .string "Another wasted week.$"

Route108_Text_H1_2::
    .string "Everything loose was taken years\n"
    .string "ago. What's left is bolted down or\l"
    .string "buried.$"

Route108_Text_H2_0::
    .string "Don't go aboard her. That's my\n"
    .string "advice, and I'm about to lose, so\l"
    .string "take it for what it's worth.$"

Route108_Text_H2_1::
    .string "Told you it was worth nothing.$"

Route108_Text_H2_2::
    .string "The doors down there swell shut\n"
    .string "with the damp. Mind which ones you\l"
    .string "close behind you.$"

Route108_Text_H3_0::
    .string "Men in blue were circling her last\n"
    .string "week. Didn't dive. Just circled.$"

Route108_Text_H3_1::
    .string "You battle like you've somewhere\n"
    .string "to be.$"

Route108_Text_H3_2::
    .string "If they wanted the ship they'd\n"
    .string "have gone in. They wanted to know\l"
    .string "how deep it sits.$"

Route108_Text_H4_0::
    .string "Swimming out to a wreck and\n"
    .string "swimming home is a whole day.\p"
    .string "Might as well battle on the way.$"

Route108_Text_H4_1::
    .string "There goes my afternoon.$"

Route108_Text_H4_2::
    .string "CAPTAIN STERN's ship passes here\n"
    .string "with its instruments out. He never\l"
    .string "stops at the wreck.\p"
    .string "Strange, for a man who likes the\n"
    .string "bottom of things.$"

Route108_Text_H5_0::
    .string "You're wearing a BADGE case and\n"
    .string "it's nearly empty. New here?$"

Route108_Text_H5_1::
    .string "Nearly empty and still too much\n"
    .string "for me.$"

Route108_Text_H5_2::
    .string "It fills up fast in HOENN. Then\n"
    .string "you find out the sea doesn't count\l"
    .string "them.$"
